---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, '');
---
<BaseLayout title="About">
<section class="section"><div class="container">
  <div class="page-hero"><div class="eyebrow">About</div><h1>Hi, I'm Avery.</h1></div>
  <div class="about-grid">
    <div class="photo-frame reveal"><img src={`${base}/images/avery-moon.jpg`} alt="Portrait of Avery Moon" /></div>
    <div class="about-copy reveal">
      <p class="lead">I help organizations work smarter by improving the systems people rely on every day.</p>
      <p>Throughout my career, I've been drawn to designing processes, documenting knowledge, improving workflows, and building business systems that help people learn faster, make better decisions, and work more effectively.</p>
      <p>My background spans aerospace manufacturing, Amazon Robotics, education partnerships, and community programs, but the common thread has never been the industry. It has always been creating clarity from complexity.</p>
      <p>My best work happens at the intersection of knowledge management, process design, and organizational effectiveness. I'm most energized by building systems that continue creating value long after implementation.</p>
      <p>At the core of my work is a longstanding interest in accessibility—not just in the traditional sense, but in how people gain access to knowledge, opportunities, resources, and communities.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions"><a class="button primary" href={`${base}/built-systems/`}>Explore My Work</a><a class="button" href={`${base}/research-writing/`}>Research & Writing</a></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div></section>
</BaseLayout>
